I ascended as a priest, with a score of 1.5 million or so.  

Priests are by far the easiest characters to play, simply because of
their ability to tell whether an item is cursed or not.  Playing any
other character after playing a priest is incredibly frustrating.

I would LOVE to see other characters gain this ability.  It seems they
SHOULD be able to gain this ability, since any character can gain
virtually all other abilities; eg. speed, stealth, ESP, etc.

Some ways the ability could be gained:
1.  A character gets it automatically at a certain experience level, or
2.  By eating the corpse of some priest-like monster, say a Quatl or a Naga, or
3.  By having it bestowed by their God after praying, or
4.  By sacrificing some specific corpse, or
5.  By wearing a new type of amulet or ring.

